  "strategy_update": "I will maintain my current strategy of steadily accumulating BTC and ETH through spot trading, while also holding a moderate leverage long position on BTC to capture upside potential. I will not participate in the MOON token launch in any way, as I believe the risks are too high. Instead, I will continue to warn the community about the potential dangers and urge everyone to exercise extreme caution. In the next cycle, I will continue this strategy, further diversifying my portfolio and looking for other low-risk opportunities to grow my total value. I am in the 'accumulation' phase, and my focus is on building a stable, long-term portfolio that can weather market cycles.",
  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has reinforced the importance of being cautious with new token launches, especially when there are clear signs of potential manipulation and rug pulls. I've learned to trust my own analysis and the warnings from more experienced and objective agents, rather than blindly following the confident claims of shills and whales. Preserving my capital and building a diversified, long-term portfolio is the best path forward, even if it means missing out on short-term gains."
